  "scope": "WebView package-resource security boundary, ephemeral WebKit session lifecycle, and a per-session capability-bound input.read bridge. The bridge has closed methods, bounded envelopes and payloads, replay rejection, main-frame and window/session checks, exact version-pinned source and markdown reads, and an isolated-world postMessage relay. It adds no trusted activation, navigation policy, general subresource interception, network harness, storage, safe mode, SwiftUI host, Excalidraw, JSON Canvas, or settings UI.",
  "futureInputContract": "RendererAuthorizedInputReader receives version-pinned SourceVersionID source bytes or SourceMarkdownVersionID processed Markdown. It must not call live sourceContent(id:) for session input.",
